The vendored disposable-email domain list in disposable-email-domains.ts (and
its raw data file data/disposable-email-blocklist.conf) is a pinned snapshot of
the community-maintained `disposable-email-domains` project:

    https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains

The exact upstream commit vendored is recorded in
data/disposable-email-blocklist.PROVENANCE.

That project dedicates its list to the public domain under the Creative Commons
CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication. The full text is reproduced below.
CC0 imposes no attribution or share-alike obligation; the credit in the source
file's header is courtesy, not a licence condition.

